---
/**
 * Room II: The Manifesto, a featured exhibit for
 * libertariantoolsuite.com/the-manifesto. The wall-text excerpts are quoted
 * verbatim from the approved copy (libertariantoolsuite MANIFESTO.md); keep
 * them that way.
 */
import Room from '../Room.astro';
import Placard from '../Placard.astro';
import { MANIFESTO_URL } from '../../../config/site';
---

<Room id="manifesto" number={2} sign="aquarius" accent="var(--room-ii)" labelledby="manifesto-title" deep>
  <div class="mf wrap">
    <div class="mf__head">
      <Placard
        id="manifesto-title"
        label="Room II · Featured exhibit"
        title="The Manifesto"
        subtitle="The Great Libertarian Data Loss"
        medium="Interactive essay. Designed and written by Michael Wilhelm."
        year="2026"
        catalog="Cat. II.01"
      />
      <div class="mf__framing prose-museum" data-reveal>
        <p class="lede">
          Twenty-five years of starting from zero. The essay traces the liberty movement&rsquo;s exposure problems
          to one root cause, data loss, and names the four ways it happens: the handoff, the tool trap, the backup
          that never existed, and the subscription guillotine.
        </p>
        <p>
          Michael designed and wrote it as interactive storytelling. The page degrades, then resolves as you turn
          it, so the reader feels the loss the argument describes and watches it repaired.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <figure class="mf__frame" data-reveal>
      <div class="mf__mat">
        <img
          src="/work/the-manifesto.webp"
          width="960"
          height="600"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          alt="The opening screen of The Great Libertarian Data Loss: the title set in a large serif on near-black, beside a ledger of section names and dates."
        />
      </div>
      <figcaption class="mf__caption">
        <span class="smallcaps">Opening screen</span>
        <span class="mono">libertariantoolsuite.com/the-manifesto</span>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="mf__walltext">
      <blockquote class="mf__excerpt" data-reveal>
        <p>
          We lost our Library of Alexandria. Ours just burned quietly, one bad handoff and one canceled subscription
          at a time.
        </p>
      </blockquote>
      <blockquote class="mf__excerpt mf__excerpt--close" data-reveal>
        <p>What already burned stays burned. Everything from here forward is ours to keep.</p>
      </blockquote>
      <p class="mf__attrib smallcaps" data-reveal>From The Great Libertarian Data Loss</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mf__cta" data-reveal>
      <a class="cta" href={MANIFESTO_URL} rel="noopener">Read the manifesto</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Room>

<style>
  .mf {
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(3rem, 2rem + 4vw, 6rem);
  }
  .mf__head {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 7fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 1rem + 4vw, 5rem);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .mf__framing {
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .mf__framing .lede {
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  /* The exhibit, hung: a charcoal frame, an ivory mat, a gilt fillet. */
  .mf__frame {
    width: min(100%, 60rem);
    margin-inline: auto;
  }
  .mf__mat {
    padding: clamp(0.75rem, 0.4rem + 2vw, 2.25rem);
    background: #fbf8f1;
    border: clamp(8px, 0.4rem + 0.6vw, 16px) solid #24211d;
    outline: 1px solid var(--gilt);
    outline-offset: calc(-1 * clamp(4px, 0.2rem + 0.3vw, 8px));
    box-shadow:
      0 2px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5),
      0 30px 60px -30px rgba(40, 28, 12, 0.55),
      0 12px 24px -12px rgba(40, 28, 12, 0.3);
  }
  .mf__mat img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
  }
  .mf__caption {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.4rem 1rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  .mf__walltext {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    max-width: 52rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .mf__excerpt p {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 1.2rem + 3vw, 3.4rem);
    line-height: 1.12;
    text-wrap: balance;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .mf__excerpt--close p {
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 1.1rem + 1.6vw, 2.3rem);
    color: var(--room-accent);
  }
  .mf__attrib {
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }
  .mf__cta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .mf__head {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
